{"id":"n14804-1-7","stage":1,"title":"동물원 · 动物园","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14804-1-7-1","ko":"토요일에 아이들 데리고 나들이 가는 게 어때요?","zh":"周六带孩子们去郊游怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"토요일에","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데리고","meaning":"带领，带","explanation":"데리다：带领，带；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"데리다","audio":"/audio/1ffe7355b76c9caa0290.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61342","senseId":"1","lemma":"데리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나들이","meaning":"串门，出行，出游","explanation":"나들이：串门，出行，出游","readings":[{"term":"나들이","audio":"/audio/8447c0adbd14f9de1a54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16298","senseId":"1","lemma":"나들이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"1ffe7355b76c9caa","term":"데리다","zh":"带领，带","audio":"/audio/1ffe7355b76c9caa0290.mp3","entryId":"61342","definition":"让某人或动物与自己在一起。","pronunciation":["데리다"]},{"id":"8447c0adbd14f9de","term":"나들이","zh":"串门，出行，出游","audio":"/audio/8447c0adbd14f9de1a54.mp3","entryId":"16298","definition":"暂时去一下离家不远的地方。","pronunciation":["나드리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c751578479a6606a0f0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14804-1-7-2","ko":"그래요. 오랜만에 동물원 구경 가요.","zh":"好啊，难得的机会，一起去动物园看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동물원","meaning":"动物园","explanation":"동물원：动物园","readings":[{"term":"동물원","audio":"/audio/f34fbaf24eb3af582b61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14804","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구경","meaning":"赏，观看，游览","explanation":"구경：赏，观看，游览","readings":[{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64484","senseId":"3","lemma":"구경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가요.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"f34fbaf24eb3af58","term":"동물원","zh":"动物园","audio":"/audio/f34fbaf24eb3af582b61.mp3","entryId":"14804","definition":"圈养各种动物，以供人观赏的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː무뤈"]},{"id":"f7bcc82cf5b9252f","term":"구경","zh":"赏，观看，游览","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3","entryId":"64484","definition":"用眼睛看或亲自体验。","pronunciation":["구ː경"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/326f31bbbdd19392eeaf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.722,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14804","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.5487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊，难得的机会，一起去动物园看看吧。","周六带孩子们去郊游怎么样？","最近的新婚生活怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["周六带孩子们去郊游怎么样？","最近的新婚生活怎么样？","好啊，难得的机会，一起去动物园看看吧。"],"answer":2}]}
